  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Luxurious Resort Retreat – 1853 Villa Lago, Palm & Par Villa<br><br>Experience the perfect blend of luxury and relaxation at Palm & Par Villa, #1853 Villa Lago, your dream vacation home! Located just steps from the sparkling blue community pool, this elegant 3-bedroom retreat is ideal for families or groups seeking a memorable beach getaway. Plus, with two golf carts included—a 4-passenger and a 6-passenger—you’ll have the freedom to explore the resort with ease.<br><br>MAIN LIVING SPACE-<br>Step inside to stunning travertine floors and soothing coastal tones, setting the stage for a truly relaxing stay. The open-concept living area features:<br>- A gourmet kitchen with stone countertops, a spacious island with breakfast bar seating for four, and a semi-formal dining area for six.<br>- A comfortable gathering space perfect for mingling with family and friends.<br>- Roku TV.<br>- A convenient half bath.<br>- A large patio with breathtaking golf course views, ideal for grilling fresh seafood, unwinding by the fire pit, or simply enjoying the breeze.<br><br>SLEEPING QUARTERS-<br>Upstairs, you’ll find three well-appointed bedrooms:<br>1. A large primary suite with a king-size bed, TV, an en-suite bathroom featuring dual sinks, a separate soaking tub, and a spacious walk-in <br> shower, plus a private terrace overlooking the golf course—perfect for morning coffee and golfer-watching.<br>2. A guest suite with a king-size bed, TV, and an en-suite bathroom featuring a shower/tub combination and a single sink.<br>3. A bunk room designed for the kids, featuring two bunk beds, an en-suite bathroom featuring a shower/tub combination and a single sink.<br><br>BONUS PERKS-<br>Enjoy the ultimate resort lifestyle with the included 4-passenger and 6-passenger golf carts, making beach trips and resort exploration effortless.<br><br>Please Note:<br>-No Smoking<br>-No Pets Allowed<br>-Russell Vacation Rentals is not responsible for any construction outside of the properties we manage.<br><br>Important Guest Information<br>Sandestin Beach Access Update – <br>Effective May 1, 2025, Sandestin Golf & Beach Resort has implemented a paid parking policy for all vehicles, including golf carts, at the resort’s beach access point. The daily parking fee is $20, and guests will pay Sandestin directly for parking.<br>Rental Agreement Requirement-<br>After booking confirmation, you will receive a Rental Agreement via email, sent as an E-Sign document with required signature fields.<br>The Rental Agreement must be signed before your arrival instructions are released.<br><br>PROPERTY DETAILS-<br>3 Bedroom 3.5 Bath Home - Sleeps 8<br>Primary King Bedroom, en suite Bath<br>Guest King Bedroom, en suite Bath<br>Guest Bunk Bedroom, 2 twin bunk beds, en suite Bath<br>2 Golf Carts - 4 Passenger, 6 Passenger<br>Golf Course Frontage<br>Private Patio with Fire Pit and Gas Grill<br>Standard and Keurig Coffee Makers<br>Access to Community Pool and 2 Resort Pools <br>Resort Beach Access<br>Wifi<br>Parking for 2 Vehicles in Driveway<br>Easy Self Check-In",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "Villa Lago Sandestin 3 Bd, 2 Golf Carts, Beach"
        }
      ],
